    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35742" root="قصب" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِقْصَابٌ</span></b>  may mean <i>A place abounding with</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَب</span> [i. e. <i>reeds,</i> or <i>canes</i>]; like as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِعْشَابٌ</span> means
“ a place abounding with [herbage of the kind
termed] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُشْب</span>. ” (Ham p. 490.)

